##

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.560 line:85%
This is an Apple AirTag.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.712 line:85%
And six months ago...

00:00:02.712 --> 00:00:05.250 line:91%
<c.yellow>I used one of them to chase Tom
all the way across London.</c>

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.110 line:91%
<c.yellow>And I came very, very close
to finding you.</c>

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.340 line:85%
You came so close.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.170 line:91%
You've got the AirTag this time.
I'm tracking you.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.240 line:91%
We're on your home turf
in Nottingham.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:12.950 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.790 line:85%
The rules are roughly the same.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.050 line:85%
You've got a list of tasks.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.430 line:91%
You get a point for
each one you complete.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:21.480 line:91%
Your job is to beat my
seven tasks from last time.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.390 line:85%
My job is to tag you first.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.770 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay. Eight points.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>You've got one hour.</c>

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.600 line:85%
<c.yellow>Alright. AirTag.</c>

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.817 line:85%
<c.yellow>It's going in the pocket.</c>

00:00:30.435 --> 00:00:32.325 align:end position:100% line:85%
List of tasks is on our phones.

00:00:32.325 --> 00:00:33.525 align:end size:94% position:94% line:91%
We haven't read it yet.
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>

00:00:33.765 --> 00:00:34.602 align:end size:94% position:94% line:85%
One hour.

00:00:35.175 --> 00:00:36.405 align:end position:100% line:85%
<c.yellow>It doesn't seem like a lot of time.</c>

00:00:36.405 --> 00:00:39.194 line:91%
Good luck, Arun.
Your time starts in 3, 2, 1.

00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:40.665 line:91%
Go!
<c.yellow>Okay, see ya!</c>

00:00:41.955 --> 00:00:43.245 line:85%
And I gotta keep looking this way.

00:00:43.245 --> 00:00:45.000 line:91%
I've just gotta stand
next to the wall here now

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.754 line:85%
and just not look at anything.

00:00:46.754 --> 00:00:49.004 line:85%
I've got five minutes now.

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:50.801 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(breathless laughing)</i></c>

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.301 line:85%
<c.yellow>Let's run.</c>

00:00:52.301 --> 00:00:54.334 position:58% line:85%
<c.yellow>At the very least, I can outpace Tom.</c>

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:55.972 line:85%
Let's see what we've got.

00:00:56.385 --> 00:00:57.714 line:85%
"AirTag rematch tasks."

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.415 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, now I need to
pull up this list of tasks.</c>

00:00:59.415 --> 00:01:00.641 line:85%
<c.yellow>Where do I need to go?</c>

00:01:01.065 --> 00:01:02.901 line:91%
<c.yellow>Oh, now I know how Tom felt.
My god!</c>

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:04.515 position:67% line:85%
"Take a trip to the oldest inn in England".

00:01:04.515 --> 00:01:06.225 position:63% line:85%
Right, that's Ye Olde Trip to Jerusalem.

00:01:06.225 --> 00:01:07.304 line:85%
I know that.

00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:09.234 line:91%
So that might be
somewhere worth going.

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:10.325 line:85%
<c.yellow>"Oldest inn in England."</c>

00:01:11.085 --> 00:01:12.367 line:85%
<c.yellow>I know where that is.</c>

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.835 line:91%
These tasks are much
less location specific.

00:01:14.835 --> 00:01:16.335 position:58% line:85%
A lot of these could happen anywhere.

00:01:16.335 --> 00:01:18.675 line:91%
<c.yellow>So one of the rules of this game
is that I can only take every</c>

00:01:18.675 --> 00:01:20.464 line:85%
<c.yellow>form of public transport once.</c>

00:01:21.675 --> 00:01:23.285 line:85%
<c.yellow>Gotta be very tactical about this.</c>

00:01:23.804 --> 00:01:28.457 line:91%
In theory, I could just sit by the
Robin Hood statue for 45 minutes,

00:01:28.457 --> 00:01:31.725 line:91%
but he could just see me and run
and get everything everywhere else.

00:01:31.725 --> 00:01:34.352 line:91%
In fact, if he's aiming right for
the Robin Hood statue,

00:01:34.352 --> 00:01:36.497 position:59% line:85%
he's either gotta get it very quickly,

00:01:36.497 --> 00:01:38.628 position:59% line:85%
so I can't possibly catch up with him,

00:01:38.628 --> 00:01:41.625 position:63% line:91%
or he knows I can wait for him there,
so that would be a bad move on his part.

00:01:41.865 --> 00:01:43.383 line:85%
<c.yellow>"Find a piece of art."</c>

00:01:43.383 --> 00:01:45.200 line:91%
<c.yellow>To be honest, there'll be
a piece of art in any building!</c>

00:01:46.746 --> 00:01:48.455 line:64%
<c.yellow>There. That counts, right?</c>

00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:51.765 line:68%
I think my only option is to
actually track him with the AirTag.

00:01:52.305 --> 00:01:54.656 line:91%
So I think I just gotta
wait out the five minutes,

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.486 line:85%
and see where he is going.

00:01:56.852 --> 00:01:58.740 line:85%
Which is really stressful!

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.640 line:91%
I was really hoping to
plan ahead here!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.742 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm just gonna text Tom
to tell him we've done one,</c>

00:02:03.742 --> 00:02:05.490 line:91%
<c.yellow>and we've only had
four minutes!</c>

00:02:05.855 --> 00:02:06.875 line:85%
One?!

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:09.330 line:91%
He's already completed a task,
and I haven't even set off yet!

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.865 line:91%
What can he have done within
three minutes of here?

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.654 line:91%
<c.yellow>What I'm gonna try and do is
to complete the less specific tasks</c>

00:02:14.654 --> 00:02:16.590 position:59% line:85%
<c.yellow>on the way to the more specific tasks.</c>

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.630 line:91%
<c.yellow>So let's try and find
a gift for Tom.</c>

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:22.050 line:85%
<c.yellow>I mean, the gift could be anything.</c>

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.644 line:85%
If I don't get an AirTag update,

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:28.240 size:88% position:56% line:91%
then my only option
in 26 seconds' time...

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.864 position:59% line:91%
...is to run for the Robin Hood statue
and just keep checking in

00:02:30.864 --> 00:02:32.474 size:88% position:56% line:85%
and hope he's gone that way.

00:02:32.474 --> 00:02:34.367 line:85%
I've had no update from the AirTag.

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:35.628 line:85%
<c.yellow>Shop, shop, shop, shop, shop.</c>

00:02:35.628 --> 00:02:36.945 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay. There's a Tesco
across the road.</c>

00:02:40.695 --> 00:02:41.355 line:85%
<c.yellow>Aha.</c>

00:02:41.355 --> 00:02:43.065 line:91%
<c.yellow>I forgot to turn my phone
on airplane mode.</c>

00:02:43.605 --> 00:02:44.403 line:85%
<c.yellow>No!</c>

00:02:45.673 --> 00:02:46.790 line:85%
Three.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.090 line:85%
Two.

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:48.749 line:85%
One.

00:02:48.749 --> 00:02:50.000 line:85%
I'm gonna try and follow him.

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.519 line:85%
<c.yellow>So the way these AirTags work is</c>

00:02:51.519 --> 00:02:54.322 line:91%
<c.yellow>they send out a Bluetooth signal
that's picked up by nearby iPhones,</c>

00:02:54.322 --> 00:02:57.390 line:91%
<c.yellow>and it's those iPhones that then
beam the location to the internet.</c>

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.630 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>So the fact that I've had my phone's
data on this whole time is not good.</c>

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:01.867 line:85%
Okay. We went the right way.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:02.970 line:91%
We went the right way.
I've got an update.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.740 line:85%
He's this way.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.719 line:91%
Two. He's got a
second task already.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:16.814 line:85%
Right.

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:20.580 line:91%
The statue, he must have
posed with the statue here.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.680 line:91%
He knew where
the statue was, I didn't.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.820 line:85%
That's home turf advantage.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.771 line:91%
He's gotta run that way
at some point.

00:03:26.771 --> 00:03:29.160 position:56% line:91%
He's got Ye Olde Trip to Jerusalem
down there, which is the oldest pub.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.740 line:85%
And he's got the Robin Hood statue.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.110 line:85%
I've got no other updates.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.320 line:85%
We gotta head that way.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.770 line:64%
<c.yellow>Robin Hood statue.</c>

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:41.930 line:64%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:44.655 line:64%
<c.yellow>Does that count?</c>

00:03:45.395 --> 00:03:46.705 line:64%
<c.yellow>Yes. Okay.</c>

00:03:47.415 --> 00:03:49.635 size:88% position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>So, oh, now I've gotta
text him three.</c>

00:03:49.635 --> 00:03:51.112 size:84% position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>Wait, there's another thing
I can do here.</c>

00:03:51.975 --> 00:03:55.995 line:91%
Anyone who thinks that an AirTag
is a good real time tracker...

00:03:56.775 --> 00:03:57.926 line:85%
Absolutely not.

00:03:58.095 --> 00:03:58.848 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:03:59.115 --> 00:04:00.045 line:85%
<c.yellow>I found another statue.</c>

00:04:01.065 --> 00:04:02.096 line:85%
<c.yellow>What are you doing?</c>

00:04:07.709 --> 00:04:08.650 line:64%
<c.yellow>Does that count?</c>

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.609 line:64%
<c.yellow>Okay, cool.</c>

00:04:12.149 --> 00:04:13.730 line:68%
<c.yellow>Not what I thought
I'd be doing today. Let's go.</c>

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.488 line:85%
He's already on three!

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:18.054 line:91%
It's what, ten minutes in,
he's already on three.

00:04:18.054 --> 00:04:19.260 line:85%
I'm nowhere near him.

00:04:19.829 --> 00:04:20.399 line:85%
Find My.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.180 line:85%
What?

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:25.200 line:85%
That can't be right.

00:04:25.469 --> 00:04:27.509 line:85%
<c.yellow>I need to text him four.</c>

00:04:27.509 --> 00:04:29.767 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>I need to get some cover,
cuz he's definitely coming this way.</c>

00:04:30.465 --> 00:04:31.784 line:91%
<c.yellow>There's no way he doesn't
know where we are.</c>

00:04:32.294 --> 00:04:34.005 line:85%
I've got no idea where he is.

00:04:34.275 --> 00:04:36.225 line:91%
Was he hidden in a doorway or
somewhere back there

00:04:36.225 --> 00:04:37.311 line:85%
and saw me run...?

00:04:38.924 --> 00:04:39.885 line:85%
No good at stealth!

00:04:41.054 --> 00:04:41.762 line:85%
Four?!

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:43.364 line:91%
<c.yellow>We need to go back to
town centre now.</c>

00:04:44.804 --> 00:04:46.815 line:91%
<c.yellow>Well, we need to take a route
that we know avoids Tom.</c>

00:04:47.775 --> 00:04:49.103 line:85%
Agh!

00:04:49.637 --> 00:04:52.200 line:91%
It's infuriating.
It is absolutely infuriating.

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:55.950 align:end position:100% line:85%
The AirTag just is not tracking him.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:59.558 position:66% line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, I think our best bet is to go
the opposite way he would expect us to go,</c>

00:04:59.558 --> 00:05:02.455 line:91%
<c.yellow>jump in an Uber and use that to
get past him going back.</c>

00:05:02.857 --> 00:05:04.140 line:85%
No updates in eight minutes.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:06.240 line:91%
Come on, this is meant
to do better than that.

00:05:07.375 --> 00:05:08.604 line:85%
<c.yellow>Gotta turn my data back on.</c>

00:05:10.145 --> 00:05:11.844 line:85%
<c.yellow>This is anxiety inducing.</c>

00:05:12.715 --> 00:05:15.385 line:91%
I'm just force-closing
and reopening Find My,

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.695 line:91%
in the hope it forces an
update from something.

00:05:19.044 --> 00:05:20.275 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay, taxi is...</c>

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.104 line:85%
<c.yellow>Ah, three minutes away.</c>

00:05:22.734 --> 00:05:25.210 line:91%
<c.yellow>Can we— Oh, Jerusalem Inn.
This is the oldest pub.</c>

00:05:26.724 --> 00:05:29.215 line:68%
<c.yellow>So it's, "Take a trip to
the oldest inn in England."</c>

00:05:29.784 --> 00:05:31.275 line:64%
<c.yellow>Okay. There we go. Good trip.</c>

00:05:33.115 --> 00:05:34.825 line:64%
He hasn't got any tasks in a while.

00:05:36.595 --> 00:05:37.645 line:85%
Let's look at the list.

00:05:37.645 --> 00:05:38.785 line:85%
What's he— What will he have got?

00:05:39.265 --> 00:05:41.226 line:85%
"Find Tom a piece—" <00:05:40.255><c>Five!</c>

00:05:42.895 --> 00:05:44.745 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay. I've just texted him five,</c>

00:05:44.745 --> 00:05:46.255 line:85%
<c.yellow>while we were in the oldest inn.</c>

00:05:46.255 --> 00:05:47.995 line:91%
<c.yellow>There's no way he doesn't know
where we are right now.</c>

00:05:48.655 --> 00:05:49.352 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh, god.</c>

00:05:52.285 --> 00:05:53.485 line:85%
<c.yellow>I'm hyper paranoid right now.</c>

00:05:53.485 --> 00:05:55.012 line:91%
<c.yellow>Every single person who's
walking past,</c>

00:05:55.012 --> 00:05:56.856 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm double checking
to see if it's Tom.</c>

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:58.075 line:85%
We got an update. He was...

00:05:59.924 --> 00:06:00.733 line:85%
What?

00:06:02.864 --> 00:06:05.325 line:91%
Nine minutes ago,
he was heading down that way.

00:06:06.284 --> 00:06:09.555 line:85%
He's on a bus, or he's on a tram,

00:06:09.555 --> 00:06:12.135 line:85%
headed to Nottingham Castle.

00:06:12.135 --> 00:06:14.453 line:91%
He's gotta be going for the
Robin Hood statue. He's got to be.

00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:16.131 line:85%
We've...

00:06:16.131 --> 00:06:18.610 position:63% line:91%
I've gotta run to the Robin Hood statue.
It's the only option I've got.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.614 line:85%
Which is this way.

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:23.505 line:91%
You ready for an uphill run?
We're going to a castle.

00:06:23.835 --> 00:06:25.455 line:91%
<c.yellow>So we are
fourteen minutes in.</c>

00:06:25.455 --> 00:06:27.284 line:91%
<c.yellow>And we've already done
five of the eight tasks.</c>

00:06:27.284 --> 00:06:28.163 line:85%
<c.yellow>This feels good.</c>

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:31.430 line:85%
<c.yellow>He must be panicking right now.</c>

00:06:32.049 --> 00:06:34.440 line:91%
If this is a wrong bet,
I'm done for!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:36.259 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.020 line:91%
<c.yellow>Thank god, okay.
We're okay.</c>

00:06:39.789 --> 00:06:41.080 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay. I'll get on the other side.</c>

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:44.520 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay. We got our car.</c>

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.338 line:85%
He went this way!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:47.640 line:85%
I know he went this way.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.510 line:85%
'Cause twelve minutes ago,

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.234 line:91%
the AirTag pinged
where we were by the statue.

00:06:53.656 --> 00:06:56.280 line:91%
Ten minutes ago, it pinged
somewhere on this street.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.858 line:91%
<c.yellow>We are in our car.
There is no Tom to be seen.</c>

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.120 line:91%
The AirTag just told me that I'd
left Arun behind somewhere.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:04.909 line:85%
Damn right, I did.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:06.728 line:85%
That's the statue.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.909 line:85%
<c.yellow>We are headed to the shops.</c>

00:07:09.659 --> 00:07:11.610 line:91%
<c.yellow>So I'm gonna try and get
a change of clothing.</c>

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:15.018 line:91%
<c.yellow>And I also need to dance
with a busker,</c>

00:07:15.018 --> 00:07:16.820 line:91%
<c.yellow>which I can safely say
I've never done before.</c>

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.757 line:91%
Four minutes ago,
he was up there.

00:07:20.849 --> 00:07:22.460 line:91%
He was up there.
He was coming for the statue.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.573 line:85%
Has he made it here yet?

00:07:26.849 --> 00:07:29.167 line:91%
<c.yellow>So at this point, I'm now gonna
turn my airplane mode on.</c>

00:07:29.167 --> 00:07:30.479 line:85%
Update, dammit!

00:07:30.479 --> 00:07:33.030 line:91%
<c.yellow>So Tom will think that this is the
last location we're at right now.</c>

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.859 line:91%
<c.yellow>We're about to leave him
behind and go into town.</c>

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:37.349 line:85%
Come on, AirTag.

00:07:37.349 --> 00:07:38.585 line:85%
I should have run here.

00:07:39.479 --> 00:07:41.580 line:91%
I had the plan.
I was gonna run here right away.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.640 line:91%
And I thought, no, I'll wait
for the AirTag tracker.

00:07:45.479 --> 00:07:46.580 line:85%
<c.yellow>This is thrilling.</c>

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.545 line:85%
Oh, I'm an idiot!

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:53.806 line:91%
Ye Olde Trip to Jerusalem,
the pub.

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:56.113 line:85%
The oldest pub is just up there.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.280 size:88% position:56% line:91%
And that's exactly where his
AirTag was five minutes ago.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.400 line:85%
And I was so fixated on the statue.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.129 position:59% line:85%
I didn't think to check that location.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.678 line:91%
<c.yellow>So I've only really got two tasks
I can do in town,</c>

00:08:06.678 --> 00:08:08.200 line:91%
<c.yellow>which is gonna take us
to seven.</c>

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.070 line:91%
<c.yellow>I need to make sure I know
what the eighth is gonna be.</c>

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.524 line:85%
He can't be coming for the statue.

00:08:11.524 --> 00:08:13.605 line:91%
If he was this close, he would've
got the statue by now.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.609 line:85%
So where's he going instead?

00:08:16.645 --> 00:08:17.565 line:85%
List of tasks.

00:08:18.134 --> 00:08:20.001 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(car horn)</i></c>

00:08:23.085 --> 00:08:24.387 line:85%
<c.yellow>Welcome to Nottingham.</c>

00:08:24.675 --> 00:08:25.815 line:85%
Why haven't I seen an update?

00:08:25.815 --> 00:08:26.715 line:85%
Where could he have gone?

00:08:27.915 --> 00:08:29.925 line:91%
If he's down Nottingham Caves,
I'll be very impressed.

